{"sourceSha256": "01e1014a52117e107f8a5d53551c35931992e215381d9b0d09fa3937e33d100e", "text": "Task\n\nAnswer the nurse’s questions about your complaints honestly, but don't be\nforthcoming and sound self-conscious in your replies.\n\nWhen asked, tell the nurse that you did not feel the need to seek any treatment\nuntil now because you thought this was a natural result of ageing. You could also\nmention social withdrawal, restrict fluid intake (sips of water), and cxercise\n\ncessation due to fear of leakage.\n\nSound alarmed about the diagnosis of urge incontinence and ask if it is treatable.\n\nBe open to the idea of seeing a doctor and using continence pads, disposable\nundergarments,\n\nSample Transcript\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nHello, My name is Gurleen, and I will be your attending nurse today,\nHow may I address you?\n\nHi, you can call me Sarah.\n\nNice to meet you, Sarah! What brings you here today?\n\nOh, | am having some problems with...um...having to go to the\nbathroom often.\n\nWould you mind if 1 asked you some questions to get a better\nunderstanding of your condition?\n\nOk,\n\nWhen you say you are going to the toilet often, is it due to your\nbowels or urination?\n\nAh, it’s for peeing mainly.\nRight. How long have you had this problem?\nI can't recall exactly...\n\nThat's alright. Can you remember if you have had this problem during\nthe past three months?\n\nNot three months. .it started...maybe...4 weeks ago.\nOk. Can you tell me how many times you have to use the bathroom in\na day?\n\nUh. It's a lor. I feel like 1 am constantly going... Once every 2-3", "pages": [{"number": 1, "text": "Task\n\nAnswer the nurse’s questions about your complaints honestly, but don't be\nforthcoming and sound self-conscious in your replies.\n\nWhen asked, tell the nurse that you did not feel the need to seek any treatment\nuntil now because you thought this was a natural result of ageing. You could also\nmention social withdrawal, restrict fluid intake (sips of water), and cxercise\n\ncessation due to fear of leakage.\n\nSound alarmed about the diagnosis of urge incontinence and ask if it is treatable.\n\nBe open to the idea of seeing a doctor and using continence pads, disposable\nundergarments,\n\nSample Transcript\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\n\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\nPatient:\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\nNurse:\n\nPatient:\n\nHello, My name is Gurleen, and I will be your attending nurse today,\nHow may I address you?\n\nHi, you can call me Sarah.\n\nNice to meet you, Sarah! What brings you here today?\n\nOh, | am having some problems with...um...having to go to the\nbathroom often.\n\nWould you mind if 1 asked you some questions to get a better\nunderstanding of your condition?\n\nOk,\n\nWhen you say you are going to the toilet often, is it due to your\nbowels or urination?\n\nAh, it’s for peeing mainly.\nRight. How long have you had this problem?\nI can't recall exactly...\n\nThat's alright. Can you remember if you have had this problem during\nthe past three months?\n\nNot three months. .it started...maybe...4 weeks ago.\nOk. Can you tell me how many times you have to use the bathroom in\na day?\n\nUh. It's a lor. I feel like 1 am constantly going... Once every 2-3", "extraction": "ocr", "layout": {"version": 1, "width": 2349.0, "height": 2800.0, "blocks": [{"text": "Task", "lines": [{"text": "Task", "x": 0.13453, "y": 0.07679, "width": 0.04598, "height": 0.01464, "confidence": 0.96, "words": [{"text": "Task", "x": 0.13453, "width": 0.04598, "confidence": 0.96}], "uncertainWords": []}]}, {"text": "Answer the nurse’s questions about your complaints honestly, but don't be\nforthcoming and sound self-conscious in your replies.", "lines": [{"text": "Answer the nurse’s questions about your complaints honestly, but don't be", "x": 0.13453, "y": 0.11036, "width": 0.72967, "height": 0